<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.640
<i>Manuipich was the path that the Willgem needed to take to reach the moon...</i>

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>...but Dianna Counter's turrets stood in our way.</i>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.740
<i>To deal with this, Sir Guin developed a plan and allowed me to join a demolition team to destroy these turrets.</i>

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:42.540
<i>We met the King of Adeska and gained his assistance.</i>

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:48.040
<i>But in turn, we were caught by insurrectionists who had betrayed the King.</i>

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.050
<b>Captured Manuipich</b>

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.510
Mayalito!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.680
- Stop this!
- Don't let him get away!

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:09.940
Militia soldier?

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.940
That's right.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:11.940
Over here, quickly!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.910
Remove your coat. I'll stop the bleeding for you.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.330
That's thoughtful of you.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.130
Adeska's in turbulent times right now.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.840
So it would seem.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.340
If you follow this waterway, you'll find your destination.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.430
You'll have to take care of the rest on your own.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.720
And yourself?

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.220
I will be returning to the King.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:45.510
You're from the Maba Clan. Why do you serve the King of Adeska?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.230
Are you also of the Maba?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.020
I don't fully know.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.730
I was with the Maba clan when I was 3 years old.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:58.610
Back then, any Adeskan child whose parents had been killed were simply left to fend for themselves at the mountain's base.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.410
I was found by a miner named Sid and taken away from here.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.620
What's your point?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.410
Manuipich is not the only city in the world.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.540
You don't have to wield a weapon to survive.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.040
Serving the King is my solemn duty.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.710
If this Quoatl is such a great King...

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.540
...why have the people of Adeska decided to band against him?

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.550
Why would they choose to fight their own King?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.630
Adeskan troubles only belong within Adeska.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.220
Mayalito...

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.840
We must hurry.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.430
Otherwise, your companions will be dead before the evening is through.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.320
Quoatl...

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.740
You are to come with us before the main alter.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:53.330
Do you know what to do, Taruka?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.710
It's just as the legends said.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:04.340
The White Devil who burned our skies crimson red has returned to claim the Ades Branch.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.720
Now, the war between the giants of heaven and earth will begin once again!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.220
I know this.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.140
Quoatl will soon lack the power to prevent this disaster.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:18.110
- That's right!
- That's it exactly!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.110
You were chosen to be the successor.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.610
You must follow the traditions of Adeska.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.240
You must defeat the King and take up his mask...

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.830
Then you will become the new King!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.740
If you refuse, Taruka...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:36.040
This weak and useless King will only bring disaster upon Adeska and her people!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.840
Take up the sword.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.920
I refuse.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.130
Why is that?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.140
As King, It is not yet my time to take up the sword.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:51.810
If you don't obey, we'll decapitate those people and their blood will stain Manuipich's waterways.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.440
In order to stop further humiliation, you must first face it yourself.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.520
You bastards!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.940
You savages... Cease this at once!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.320
Taruka, tell Deptle to stop this!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.910
If that's what you want, you must first draw your sword.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.910
What is the purpose of this?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:14.540
The burning sky, and the appearance of my White Devil...

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.040
...These things are not King Quoatl's fault!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.630
This is something you must understand!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.420
Why must you use a foolish practice!?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.220
This is our way of life that helped us survive!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.010
An outsider like you has no right to criticize it.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:34.020
Taruka, these people here have come to destroy those cannons which the people from the sky use to ensnare this village.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.230
There's no reason to believe what the King says.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:41.940
This King is no longer our ruler. He's a man who merely fled downhill and abandoned us!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.530
Take the sword.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.610
Taruka!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.910
Majesty, please draw your sword.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.410
This sword... I shall not.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.330
Remove his head!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:00.710
Why you...!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.130
Please, don't!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:07.930
Up there?

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:08.930
What?

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.640
Forget the swords!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.720
The alter's been...

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.020
What the!?

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:16.930
Explosives?

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:18.810
Joseph?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.440
Miss Mayalito!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.110
Majesty, if you will not draw your sword...

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:24.940
Currently...

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.240
At this moment, I cannot draw a sword against you.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.320
For the sake of preventing a war between the giants...

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.830
I must assist these outsiders.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.740
Your Majesty?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.410
Mayalito!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.540
Sir!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:43.540
King Quoatl, If you refuse to hand over your position as King...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.630
Adeska will fall.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.340
What in the world are you wishing for?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:52.720
The path to the right?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.220
No, it's heavily guarded.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.220
I'll ride a boat down the secret waterway.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.220
Right.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.310
This way.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:10.030
Taruka, it seems that they aren't going through the west route.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:15.030
If they went by the waterway, and aren't using the western route...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.120
Could they be...

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.410
- Follow me.
- Sir!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:25.420
A river?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:30.510
What the hell is this? It's a dead end!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.220
This is the only remaining route to Manuipich at the...

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.640
Don't bother explaining it. We're not some band of tourists.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.640
The King mentioned something about a boat, did he not?

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:40.810
Correct.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.520
Is that what he said?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.730
He didn't just run away, did he?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.810
His Majesty is not that sort of man.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.820
That's right, isn't it.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.320
Our uninvited guests are here.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.320
How many?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.450
Not a lot.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.410
Then, please don't use the explosives against them.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.620
That had been my plan.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.040
Another one of them fled.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.840
He probably went to summon others.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.130
I think so too.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.130
The King hasn't come yet.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.220
He'll be here.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.930
Are you sure he didn't flee?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.720
Quoatl's a useless cowards who cares only for himself.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.510
You're wrong! That's a lie!
- Hmm?

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.810
He never even bothered to pick up his sword, but instead reacted like a coward and fled!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.230
This isn't the attitude of a true Adeskan king!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.110
I cannot accept hearing a speech like that come from you!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.320
Mayalito!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.240
Better hold off, little Miss.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.030
Don't get in my way!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.250
If you say such things once more, I'll cut out your tongue!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:46.210
I will not forgive you, even if you are the man everyone has chosen!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.920
Damn it Mayalito...

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.130
Think back.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:53.630
On that night when the people dreamed of the red sky...

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:58.930
Ascending King Taruka!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.010
Defeat the old King!

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.310
Become our protector!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:07.150
Defeat the old King! Become our protector!

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:13.030
You were the one whom our people had chosen. According to our traditions, you were to take your sword and challenge King Quoatl.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.740
But at that time, you lost your nerve.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:20.240
Do you not understand the significance of that?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:25.210
If you become King and cannot live up to the responsibility of preventing this calamity...

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:29.540
The people of Adeska will be left without hope.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:35.510
Back then, you were afraid of carrying the burden of your people's destiny!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.010
I was...

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.850
Did you honestly think the King never noticed?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.310
He knew about it?

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:46.640
Ascending King Taruka! Defeat the old King!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.730
The reason the King fled, was in order to...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.320
He intended to give you time.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:55.030
So that you could become the true King of Adeska.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:58.910
He was ready to give up his life.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.240
The way a person in his position was crushed by his own people's insults...

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.240
You couldn't understand that, Tarkuka.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.710
Here they come.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.330
Knock it down!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.710
Deptle?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.130
Is that bad?

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.340
Where is that King?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.630
His Majesty is here now.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.130
Jump in!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.220
Quickly!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.430
Are you alright?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.310
I'll be fine.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:27.930
Taruka!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.020
Take this!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.610
- Are you alright?
- They're running!

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:37.320
Mayalito!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.410
Give me your hand!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.830
Just a bit more...

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.540
Come on, stretch your arms...

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.830
Good job, Mayalito.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:54.340
The old King is heading for Manuipich!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.130
No...

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.720
Quoatl is not the old King yet.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.930
Nor is he a King who needs to die now.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.140
Is that Manuipich?

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.220
That's...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.310
This...

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.430
The temple's been...

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.140
We're here.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.520
This time, you're going to have to stay behind.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.030
Otherwise, that bomb in your chest might explode...

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.110
And then you'll truly become an accursed White Devil.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.120
Was there any signal from Manuipich yet?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:30.040
If something doesn't happen soon, the Willgem will kill Ames and Loran.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.040
It'll be morning soon...

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.130
The airplanes are on their way here, right?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.340
If the rest of us can pull something off...

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.420
Sir Guin won't need to fire the Willgem's cannons.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.510
You think so?

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.930
So, let's have the Suicide and Jalopy teams deploy!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.720
I'm with you.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:48.140
Incoming.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:52.940
Hey! Over here!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.110
- Is this the place?
- Yep!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.130
You people are late.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:22.340
It's amazing that they can land at night like this.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:26.930
It's nothing. They've been training to do things like this for almost a decade now.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.640
Do you have all the bombs we requested?

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:46.200
I was able to obtain this boat thanks to everyone's efforts.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:49.830
It'd all be for nothing if we lost that sack along the way.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.830
Those cannons are in this direction, right?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:55.000
That mountain looks a bit like an old tree stump.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:59.500
That is what's left from the Ades World Tree.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.510
The areas on the sides of the alter also show evidence of where its roots once lay.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:10.220
We've seen evidence that suggests the tree was cut down during the war between the giants of the sky and earth.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:15.230
Could this place be the legendary stairway to heaven? The place with stairs that lead to heaven's bagworm?

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.310
How's it look?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:21.320
It's no good. Dianna Counter set up lights to illuminate the damaged portion of the ancient temple.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.820
But there doesn't seem to be anyone posted there.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:28.910
This Dianna Counter you speak of has placed 3 cannons each in 2 separate locations, both to the north and west.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:32.120
Then in that case, Ames and I will take care of the 3 to the north.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.200
Loran and Sid will be responsible for the ones on the west side.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.410
Do you understand, Uncle Sid?

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.840
It's not a problem, but we'll need to destroy all 6 at the same time.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:44.630
In that case, we just need to do it before Sir Guin carries out his plan.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:47.220
It will be a difficult climb up there. Are you certain you'll be alright?

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:52.010
If we don't do it, the Willgem's cannon will burn away these turrets along with the entire city.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.810
Furthermore, even if that didn't happen, Dianna Counter would still trash this place anyway.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:59.810
Understood. Then I'll take you to the western location, young man!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.730
Right! I thank you for that, Quoatl.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.110
I too will accompany the King.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.320
An elderly man will be with you, so please be careful.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.700
You're easily swayed, you know?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.540
Did you fall for that girl now?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.040
No, it's not that.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.930
Is that it?

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.740
Not many on watch.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:50.910
We'll take it out.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.920
Loran, can you do it?

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.510
In that case, I'll go on to the next one.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.800
Please do.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.810
A report from our scouting unit?

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:30.240
It looks like an Almaiya class is moving towards Manuipich from the sea.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.110
We can't wait any longer.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:36.120
Chief Horace, please prepare the Mega Particle Cannon.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.410
Roger.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.910
Tell Chief Ladderum to have our fighter plane division distract the enemy.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.000
Understood.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.130
Do you really intend to use the main cannons?

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.920
It must be stopped...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.720
What's the matter?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.430
H...Hello? I'm opening this door!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.020
Forgive me!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.310
That's it!

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.400
Here, too.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.820
Now we just wait for Loran's group.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.900
If he's with the King and Gramps...

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.240
They'll be fine.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.200
Which button will keep it from firing?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.530
Which one?

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.040
Which one is it!?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.200
The enemy battleship is approaching now.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.830
Their target is the Willgem.

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.710
Things will be fine if we were to back down.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:29.500
Located within that City is a device called a Mass Driver. We need it if we wish to bring this ship into space.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.210
Mass.. Drive...?

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:34.430
With that, the Willgem will be capable of reaching the moon.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:38.720
Then are you suggesting we forsake Loran, the others, and that city to pursue that goal!?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.020
I told Laura and the others that we would attack at dawn.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.810
They should have retreated by now.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.810
Chief Horace, fire.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.810
- Yes.
- Hold it! Please wait a bit longer!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:48.730
Sir!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.740
The Suicide and Jalopy teams have spread out along the mountainside!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.740
I didn't order them to deploy!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.910
Hey, Colonel!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.910
I wanted to have a chance to show off the Luzianna Militia's fighting power again!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.330
Your Majesty!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.420
There they are!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.420
There's still one more cannon emplacement that hasn't been fitted with a bomb...

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.010
We'll make sure to clear a path for Loran's group!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.440
That cannon is aiming in our direction...

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.900
Everyone, don't attack! Worry about dodging the beam!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.030
Another?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.830
The Adeskan people have come here?

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:46.000
We can still defeat these miniature Mechanical Dolls with our weapons!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.830
We must open a path to assist our King!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.840
Taruka, have you come to fight for my sake?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.210
Majesty!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.510
Shoot, Shoot, SHOOT THEM!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.430
Sochie, can you stop them?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.640
No, I can't. They're attacking from both sides.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.230
Watch yourself, Miashei!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.900
They aren't used to such tiny things like airplanes. They won't be able to hit us.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.740
Use the smoke screen cover to get in closer!

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:21.620
Majesty, you can get the cannon's soldiers away from this place.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.830
That's far enough.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.540
Stand up!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.700
When did you...?

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.410
Put your hands up.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:28.920
The timer!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.500
I can't believe they would install something like this.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.130
Success!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.920
We did it? No...

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.630
There's still one cannon left.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.930
You little...

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.010
You people destroyed our turrets!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.930
That's enough!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.100
Take that!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.100
Majesty!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.440
Here in Adeska, we have no need for such cannons!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.400
You useless backwater primitives!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.820
Mayalito...

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.030
Miss Mayalito!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.110
Get out of here.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.400
And you too!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.410
Ma'am!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.120
Don't allow the mechanical soldiers to come any closer!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.200
Fire!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.830
Loran...

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:17.710
You said you intend to dispose of the bombs which stain the sky red in space, right?

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.720
Yes, that's correct.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.010
You must now fulfill that vow.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.430
Of course I shall!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.100
What in the world are planning to do!?

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.930
Quoatl...

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:32.230
Mayalito, I want you to follow that young man.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.740
Taruka, shoot me!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.620
Quoatl!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.830
King Quoatl!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:57.710
You must now obey our traditions and bring my old era to a close for Adeska's sake!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:58.920
Majesty!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.430
At this moment, Taruka has the right to kill me.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.640
I decree that he has the right to do so!

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.010
Majesty!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:11.230
Don't hesitate. Mayalito, you must leave.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.310
Taruka, this is our King's hope!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:18.320
Your Majesty, in the name of the Branch of Ades, I hope you'll rest in peace.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.400
Taruka!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.400
Mayalito...

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:24.200
After this, you shall take my place as the new King.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.820
I'll stay by your side.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:31.830
What's Mayalito still doing up there when they're about to change Kings!?

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:39.420
May you ascend and grasp the Ades Branch!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:40.710
Ascend?

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.930
How could... How could you do something like that, Mayalito!?

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.310
Quoatl...

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.610
...ascend to the branch, in flight as a hawk!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.530
Our lives and future have now been secured!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.620
Manuipich has been taken.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.200
So it seems.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.710
Just as dawn broke...

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.800
The Adeskan people's new King.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:31.430
Our ever revered King, Quoatl never shed tears nor hesitated.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.230
There's nothing else that could've been done.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:47.110
Why couldn't I do anything for her?

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.700
Quoatl used to say...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:55.200
...that when the White Devil would return to take the Ades branch, our mythology would reach its end.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.330
Is that so?

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.500
That, up there, is the Ades branch!

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.010
Quoatl...

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:09.800
I will use your Ades Branch, the Zacktraeger, to ensure I fulfill my vow and cast the nuclear bombs out in deep space.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:16.430
I'll travel there while controlling the one you called the White Devil... I'll go together with the White Doll.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:45.610
<i>On the day the ship Mr. Will Game left us is ready to reach space, Lieutenant Poe pursues and attacks us.</i>

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:50.150
<i>However, due to the Nuclear Bomb in the chest of the White Doll...</i>

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:51.700
<i>I can't just carelessly do whatever I want.</i>

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:56.740
<i>That's because I don't wish for my mobile suit to truly become the "White Devil".</i>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.750
<i>Next Time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.040
<i>Fly! Through The Stratosphere</i>

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.330
<i>"The wind flows through space."</i>

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Fly! Through The Stratosphere</b>
